## Why they were merged

[Decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject) merges on subject line. "Wrong day on
the invite" fits all three problems, so all three ended up in one ticket. Its consequences
expected different subjects for one bug; here one subject covers three bugs.

